          "text": "Testimonies:\n\nVILLERS-LES-LUXEUIL (70) 12/14/1984 T1 Case Number 539 (1984306946).pdf\nMARNANS (38) 12/14/1984 Case Number 846 (1984306947).pdf\nVILLERS-LES-LUXEUIL (70) 12/14/1984 T2 Case Number 539 (1984306946).pdf\nVILLERS-LES-LUXEUIL (70) 12/14/1984 T3 Case Number 539 (1984306946).pdf",
